# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/
*.egg
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/

# Rust
# Any Cargo target dir at any depth, plus the ad-hoc `target-<purpose>` /
# `target_<purpose>` dirs used for isolated check/test runs. Deliberately not
# `target*/`, which would also swallow `projects/dogfood/radgui/targets/`.
target/
target-*/
target_*/
**/*.rs.bk

# Compiled binaries
*.exe
*.pdb
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

